## Why This Is Asked

This question assesses incident leadership skills—specifically the ability to make quick, data-driven decisions under pressure while balancing product velocity with system reliability. It tests understanding of rollback versus patch tradeoffs and stakeholder management during high-stress situations.

## Key Concepts

- Ownership and accountability in incident response
- Data-driven decision making under pressure
- Stakeholder alignment and clear communication
- Risk assessment: rollback vs. patch tradeoffs

## Code Example

```javascript
function triage(telemetry) {
  const scope = assessScope(telemetry);
  const rootCause = identifyRootCause(scope);

  if (isLowRiskRollback()) {
    executeRollback();
  } else {
    deployKillSwitch();
  }

  communicateStakeholders(resolution);
  return monitorRecovery();
}
```

